0/10 Too much broken.
This game is like shoving your fingers in a meat grinder:
-Input lag if you are not using a controller;(the rest of the game is a good port and is well optimized)
-Enemies can hit you through walls(and other solid objects), you can't;
-Even if you do everything right ,some NPCs can glitch out and you cannot finish their questlines(looking at you Lucatiel);
-Combat is basically 95% attrition on both sides. The rest is dying from horrible hit boxes;
-Secrets that need defiance of common sense(real life or video game) to discover;
-Trolls messages left that WILL screw you over due to high upvotes (please leave messages pointing out liars :) );
-Troll messages left in front of hidden walls which prevents you from opening them;
-Horrible hit boxes,even worse than the original Dark Souls(think Mushroom people then extend it to pretty much every enemy);
-You have a higher chance of dying from falling due to bad colision detection than enemies;
-Some weapons degrade faster than others (not sure if fix does not extend to all weapons or is a bug);
Better alternative :
Ask for oral from someone, and request using their teeth.
Pros:
-Large variety of locations ,weapons and styles;
-Enemies are usually copy pasted in DLCs, just with different skins;(though the DLCs have superior level design)
-If you do buy the game get the axes, they're OP for a good part of the game;
-Amazing chests everywhere ... and women with nice boobs as well;

